# Check:    bash tools/css/verify_testdata.sh
#
# The ten files below are the ones that test CSS SYNTAX LEVEL 3 (the
# tokenizer and the parser entry points). The color_*.json files of the same
# repository test the <color> grammar of CSS Color 3/4/5 -- a different
